# Analysis output, regenerated on every run — never source.
#
# `scripts/lib/mcb.sh validate` writes mcb-validate-internal-report.json here on
# every `make check WHAT=validate`. While these files were tracked, that write
# was seen as a working-tree mutation by the serialized fingerprint guard, and
# the read-only check aborted with "workspace changed during serialized Make
# check" even though all 19 validators reported zero violations.
#
# The root .gitignore is generated by `flext_infra codegen conform`, so a
# `reports/` rule added there is dropped on the next `make gen`. This nested
# file is project-owned and survives regeneration.
*
!.gitignore
